  <name>Kadr</name>
  <summary>Batch crop multiple images</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Kadr crops several images in one batch. Apply one crop to every image, or set a separate crop for selected files.</p>
    <p>Save cropped copies or replace originals with backup and undo support. The application supports image formats provided by the installed GdkPixbuf modules.</p>
  </description>
